{{Quote|She took a skimmer?|[[Jannah]]|<ref name="Episode 9">{{Film|VIII}}</ref>}}
[[File:HS-19_Cargo_Loading_Transport_Skimmer.png|thumb|right|260px|An HS-19 cargo loading transport skimmer.]]
A '''skimmer''' was a [[repulsorlift]] vehicle similar to a [[skiff]]. The [[Aki-Aki]] [[farmer]]s of [[Pasaana]] used skimmers to travel large distances when planting crops, utilizing models such as the [[Arunskin 75D skimmer]] and the [[HS-19 cargo loading transport skimmer]].<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> The [[sea skiff]] crafts used by [[Company 77]] on the [[ocean]] [[moon]] of [[Kef Bir]] were also sometimes referred to as skimmers.<ref name="Episode IX">{{Film|IX}}</ref>

